*NAME ERR_COMMON2
*PUNCH
*ALGOL                                             04 ИЮЛ 24 23.45
A L G O L - Г Д P
    (7.01.82)
           1. ′COMMENT′ ′COMMON′ ELEMENTS DECLARED OUT OF OR
               DER, NOT DECLARED,
           2.     OR DECLARED AS A PROCEDURE;
           3. ′BEGIN′
           4.     ′COMMON′ /A/ X, Y;
           5.     ′REAL′ Y, X;
           6.     ′COMMON′ /B/ U, V;
           7.     ′REAL′ U;
           8.     ′COMMON′ /C/ F;
           9.     ′INTEGER′ ′PROCEDURE′ F; F := 1;
          10.     X := 1;
          11.     PRINT(X)
          12. ′END′
          13. ′EOP′
